  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-12-05T16:19:24.146Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I don't mind supporting VRchat at all for the years of entertainment I've gotten out of it and the  friends i've met.. Discarding the discussion of set price.\nI personally feel like the roadmap of VRC+ its financial gain lacks transparency.. there is no roadmap or clear indication of what that money will result in doing for the future of VRchat.. \nI want the platform to become better but seeing several things in a planned stage since 2017: I get concerned.\nPlease add goals/roadmaps or maybe even a counter of VRC+ users with set goals for development! Something like this happened as well for when for example runescape relaunched OSRS where the amount of paying/voting users determined their team, their deadlines publically so that people know what they would be paying towards other then a gesture of kindness.",
